        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a 2D sliding tile-merging puzzle game inspired by 2048.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. In this game, you need to merge tiles on the board to reach each level’s objective. Be careful — over-merging can lead to failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. You can clear levels with any number of moves, or carefully plan the best strategy. If you complete a level in the minimum number of moves, you will earn a star. Levels marked EX<strong> </strong>have no move requirement—you only need to clear them to earn a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Most levels take under 10 moves to solve, and none go over 30. Don’t worry about making it too complicated—sometimes it’s just a small trick, other times just skipping a few extra moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. The game features a dynamic unlock system. Completed levels and earned stars will help unlock new stages. Feel free to explore and enjoy the game at your own pace.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a 2D sliding tile-merging puzzle game inspired by 2048.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. In this game, you need to merge tiles on the board to reach each level’s objective. Be careful — over-merging can lead to failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. You can clear levels with any number of moves, or carefully plan the best strategy. If you complete a level in the minimum number of moves, you will earn a star. Levels marked EX<strong> </strong>have no move requirement—you only need to clear them to earn a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Most levels take under 10 moves to solve, and none go over 30. Don’t worry about making it too complicated—sometimes it’s just a small trick, other times just skipping a few extra moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. The game features a dynamic unlock system. Completed levels and earned stars will help unlock new stages. Feel free to explore and enjoy the game at your own pace.</p>",
        "short_description": "A 2D sliding tile-merging puzzle game inspired by 2048.",
